# examples/asn1/ext.asn1: random values against pycrate, asn1c and rasn (no hand vectors;
# examples/src/bin/ext.rs checks encodings by hand). rasn 0.28 rejects a SEQUENCE whose
# mandatory extension addition is absent and misreads extension groups (tests/x691/README.md).
deviates rasn AllOpt
deviates rasn Carrier
deviates rasn Ext
deviates rasn Grouped
deviates rasn Listed
deviates rasn One
